OL,3,GNEWSAApocalypse prepper cleared of bomb
OL,4,Aoffence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who said he was preparing for a
OL,7,F"post-apocalyptic scenario" has been
OL,8,Fcleared by jurors of trying to harm
OL,9,Fpeople with a homemade bomb.
OL,11,FMore than 80 addresses were evacuated
OL,12,Fon 10 March after bomb disposal teams
OL,13,Ffound a device at Ben Banham's home in
OL,14,FEssex.
OL,16,FThe father-of-two told Basildon Crown
OL,17,FCourt he only planned to use it "to
OL,18,Fprotect his family home" in a disaster
OL,19,Fsituation.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
